---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";

import schoolImage from "../../assets/img/school.png";
---

<Layout lang="en">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="GKŠM Labs is a student organization at Gymnázium Karola Štúra in Modra. Connecting students who want to create real, valuable projects for their school and community."
    />
    <meta name="author" content="Peter Packa" />
    <meta
      name="keywords"
      content="GKŠM Labs, students, Modra, school organization, projects, Gymnázium Karola Štúra, school projects, community, IT, student activities"
    />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />

    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="About Us | GKŠM Labs" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="GKŠM Labs is a student organization at Gymnázium Karola Štúra in Modra. Real projects by students."
    />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://labs.gksm.sk/en" />
    <meta
      property="og:image"
      content={"https://labs.gksm.sk" + schoolImage.src}
    />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="GKŠM Labs" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" />

    <link rel="canonical" href="https://labs.gksm.sk/en" />
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://labs.gksm.sk" hreflang="sk" />
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://labs.gksm.sk/en" hreflang="en" />

    <title>About us | GKŠM Labs</title>
  </Fragment>
  <main class="mt-26 min-h-screen">
    <section
      class="mx-auto flex min-h-176 max-w-5xl flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-12"
    >
      <h1
        class="mb-16 text-center text-4xl font-black underline decoration-amber-400 decoration-wavy sm:text-5xl"
      >
        We are students who make things happen
      </h1>
      <div
        class="flex w-full flex-col justify-center gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start"
      >
        <div
          class="mb-4 flex w-full justify-center md:mb-0 md:w-1/4 md:justify-end"
        >
          <Image
            src={schoolImage}
            alt="Picture of the school"
            class="w-full max-w-60 object-cover shadow md:w-auto md:-rotate-3"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-2/4">
          <p
            class="mb-4 text-justify text-lg leading-relaxed hyphens-auto sm:text-xl"
          >
            <span class="font-black">GKŠM Labs</span> is a student organization at&nbsp;
            <a
              href="https://gymmo.edupage.org/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-amber-400 underline transition hover:text-amber-500"
            >
              Karol Štúr Gymnasium in Modra
            </a>. We connect students who want to create real things for their
            school, from websites to projects that are used daily by both
            students and teachers.
          </p>
          <p
            class="mb-4 text-justify text-base leading-relaxed hyphens-auto text-gray-700 sm:text-lg"
          >
            We are not just another school club; we are a group of students who
            decided to do more for their school than others. We were created by
            the initiative of students themselves who wanted to make something
            real and meaningful. Something that the school actually uses, which
            has a real impact on the daily lives of both students and teachers.
            We do everything from websites, graphic design, to other projects
            that make the whole school run smoother. Every project we create
            doesn’t collect dust in a drawer; it lives on and serves the people
            around us.
          </p>
          <p
            class="mb-4 text-justify text-base leading-relaxed hyphens-auto text-gray-700 sm:text-lg"
          >
            Our members are students of various years, united by one thing: a
            desire to create something meaningful. They work in teams, where
            everyone contributes in their own way. Some code, some design, some
            organize. We don’t require experience or technical knowledge, just
            an interest and willingness to get involved. In GKŠM Labs, everyone
            learns something, and everyone leaves something behind.
          </p>
          <p
            class="mb-4 text-justify text-base leading-relaxed hyphens-auto text-gray-700 sm:text-lg"
          >
            However, we are not a closed community just for the students
            of&nbsp;
            <a
              href="https://gymmo.edupage.org/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-amber-400 underline transition hover:text-amber-500"
            >
              Karol Štúr Gymnasium
            </a>. We also collaborate with students from other schools who share
            the same enthusiasm and desire to create. This cooperation brings us
            new perspectives, ideas, and experiences that make our projects even
            better. We believe that together, we can achieve more.
          </p>
          <p
            class="text-justify text-base leading-relaxed hyphens-auto text-gray-700 sm:text-lg"
          >
            We believe that students can create things of real value, not
            sometime in the future, but right now. That’s why we do more for the
            school than others, and that’s what motivates us to keep moving
            forward every day.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-8 text-center text-xs text-gray-500 md:text-left">
            This page is not the official page of the&nbsp;
            <a
              href="https://gymmo.edupage.org/"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="text-amber-400 underline transition hover:text-amber-500"
            >
              Karol Štúr Gymnasium in Modra
            </a>. It is a student project and a presentation of the club <span
              class="font-black">GKŠM Labs</span
            >.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
